---
const title = 'Zymplo · Cyberpunk Lab · V06';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0A0014" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://sims.zymplo.com/brand/isotipo.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" />
    <style is:inline>
      :root { --bg: #0A0014; --bg-2: #1A0028; --pink: #FF006E; --cyan: #00F0FF; --green: #00FF85; --yellow: #FFEE00; --paper: #FAFBFF; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; background: var(--bg); color: var(--paper); min-height: 100vh; overflow-x: hidden; }

      /* scanlines */
      body::before { content: ''; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,240,255,0.03) 0px, rgba(0,240,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 3px); pointer-events: none; z-index: 999; }
      /* CRT vignette */
      body::after { content: ''; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at center, transparent 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 100%); pointer-events: none; z-index: 998; }

      .grid-3d { position: fixed; bottom: -10%; left: 0; right: 0; height: 60vh; perspective: 600px; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.55; z-index: 0; }
      .grid-3d-inner { position: absolute; inset: 0; transform: rotateX(70deg) translateY(20%); background-image: linear-gradient(var(--cyan) 2px, transparent 2px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan) 2px, transparent 2px); background-size: 60px 60px; animation: grid-scroll 8s linear infinite; mask-image: linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0%, black 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0%, black 100%); }
      @keyframes grid-scroll { from { background-position: 0 0; } to { background-position: 0 60px; } }

      /* mesh blobs */
      .blob { position: fixed; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(120px); opacity: 0.45; }
      .blob.b1 { top: -10%; left: -5%; width: 50vw; height: 50vw; background: var(--pink); }
      .blob.b2 { top: 20%; right: -10%; width: 40vw; height: 40vw; background: var(--cyan); animation: float-cy 16s ease-in-out infinite; }
      @keyframes float-cy { 50% { transform: translate(-30px, 40px); } }

      .nav-back { position: fixed; top: 14px; left: 14px; z-index: 1000; padding: 5px 11px 5px 6px; background: rgba(255,0,110,0.15); color: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--pink); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
      .nav-back img { height: 16px; }
      .lab-badge { position: fixed; top: 14px; right: 14px; z-index: 1000; padding: 5px 11px; background: rgba(0,240,255,0.12); color: var(--cyan); border: 1px solid var(--cyan); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--cyan); }

      .topbar { position: relative; z-index: 5; padding: 14px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,240,255,0.25); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--cyan); }
      .topbar .pulse { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green); margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle; box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--green); animation: pulse-cy 1.4s ease-out infinite; }
      @keyframes pulse-cy { 0%,100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(0,255,133,0.7), 0 0 12px var(--green); } 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(0,255,133,0), 0 0 12px var(--green); } }

      .hero { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 80px 22px 100px; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .term { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--green); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
      .term::before { content: '> '; color: var(--pink); }

      h1 { font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(44px, 9.5vw, 140px); line-height: 0.92; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 28px 0; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h1 .neon { color: var(--paper); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--cyan), 0 0 30px var(--cyan), 0 0 60px rgba(0,240,255,0.5); }
      h1 .pink-neon { color: var(--paper); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--pink), 0 0 30px var(--pink), 0 0 60px rgba(255,0,110,0.5); }
      h1 .glitch { position: relative; display: inline-block; color: var(--paper); }
      h1 .glitch::before, h1 .glitch::after { content: attr(data-t); position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; }
      h1 .glitch::before { color: var(--cyan); transform: translate(-3px, 0); mix-blend-mode: screen; clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 30%, 0 30%); animation: glitch-1 4s steps(1) infinite; }
      h1 .glitch::after { color: var(--pink); transform: translate(3px, 0); mix-blend-mode: screen; clip-path: polygon(0 60%, 100% 60%, 100% 100%, 0 100%); animation: glitch-2 5s steps(1) infinite; }
      @keyframes glitch-1 { 0%,90%,100% { clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 30%, 0 30%); transform: translate(0,0); } 92% { clip-path: polygon(0 10%, 100% 10%, 100% 25%, 0 25%); transform: translate(-3px,2px); } 95% { clip-path: polygon(0 70%, 100% 70%, 100% 80%, 0 80%); transform: translate(2px,-1px); } }
      @keyframes glitch-2 { 0%,88%,100% { clip-path: polygon(0 60%, 100% 60%, 100% 100%, 0 100%); transform: translate(0,0); } 91% { clip-path: polygon(0 35%, 100% 35%, 100% 50%, 0 50%); transform: translate(3px,-2px); } 94% { clip-path: polygon(0 80%, 100% 80%, 100% 95%, 0 95%); transform: translate(-2px,1px); } }

      .sub { font-size: clamp(15px, 1.8vw, 19px); color: rgba(250,251,255,0.75); max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 22px; }

      .cta-row { margin-top: 36px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
      .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 16px 26px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; transition: all 0.2s; position: relative; }
      .btn-pink { background: var(--pink); color: var(--paper); border: 2px solid var(--pink); box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255,0,110,0.5), inset 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
      .btn-pink:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--pink); box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(255,0,110,0.8); }
      .btn-cy { background: transparent; color: var(--cyan); border: 2px solid var(--cyan); }
      .btn-cy:hover { background: rgba(0,240,255,0.1); box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0,240,255,0.5); }
      .btn::after { content: '→'; }

      .micro { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(0,240,255,0.7); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
      .micro span::before { content: '◆ '; color: var(--pink); }
      .micro span { margin-right: 18px; }

      .stats { margin-top: 60px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
      .st { padding: 22px; background: rgba(0,240,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0,240,255,0.25); position: relative; }
      .st::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-top: 2px solid var(--pink); border-left: 2px solid var(--pink); }
      .st::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--cyan); border-right: 2px solid var(--cyan); }
      .st .v { font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); color: var(--paper); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--cyan); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
      .st .l { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 10px; color: rgba(0,240,255,0.85); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }

      .feats { padding: 80px 22px; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
      .feats h2 { font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); color: var(--paper); text-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--pink); margin-bottom: 32px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .feat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
      .fc { padding: 24px; background: rgba(255,0,110,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,0,110,0.3); transition: all 0.3s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
      .fc::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 30%, rgba(0,240,255,0.06) 50%, transparent 70%); transform: translateX(-100%); transition: transform 0.6s; }
      .fc:hover { border-color: var(--cyan); box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0,240,255,0.3); }
      .fc:hover::before { transform: translateX(100%); }
      .fc .ic { font-size: 26px; }
      .fc .t { font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 14px; color: var(--paper); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
      .fc .d { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(250,251,255,0.7); line-height: 1.5; }

      .footer { padding: 40px 22px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(0,240,255,0.5); border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,240,255,0.15); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
      .footer a { color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; }
      .footer a:hover { color: var(--paper); text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--cyan); }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .glitch::before, .glitch::after { animation: none !important; } .grid-3d-inner { animation: none; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="blob b1"></div>
    <div class="blob b2"></div>
    <div class="grid-3d"><div class="grid-3d-inner"></div></div>

    <a class="nav-back" href="/lab/"><img src="https://sims.zymplo.com/brand/isotipo.svg" alt="Zymplo" />← LAB</a>
    <a class="lab-badge" href="/lab/">[06] CYBERPUNK</a>

    <div class="topbar">
      <span><span class="pulse"></span>SYS://CONNECTED · 13 NODES · 3 LANGS</span>
      <span style="color: var(--pink);">$ 47.28M · LIVE</span>
    </div>

    <main class="hero">
      <div class="term">init zymplo://secretary --mode=whatsapp --plan=free</div>

      <h1>
        <span class="neon">COBRÁ</span> SIN<br/>
        <span class="glitch" data-t="PERSEGUIR">PERSEGUIR</span><br/>
        <span class="pink-neon">LA IA</span> HACE<br/>
        <span class="glitch" data-t="TODO">TODO</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="sub">Tu secretaria IA dentro de WhatsApp. Cobra · factura · agenda · organiza. Sin app · sin signup · sin fricción. Vivís en el futuro · te lo merecés.</p>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-pink" href="https://wa.me/595981970735?text=Quiero%20probar%20Zymplo">EMPEZAR GRATIS</a>
        <a class="btn btn-cy" href="#feats">VER STACK</a>
      </div>
      <div class="micro"><span>SIN APP</span><span>SIN REGISTRO</span><span>FREE FOREVER</span></div>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="st"><div class="v">$ 47.28M</div><div class="l">cobrados / mes</div></div>
        <div class="st"><div class="v">12.847</div><div class="l">activos hoy</div></div>
        <div class="st"><div class="v">13</div><div class="l">países latam+us</div></div>
        <div class="st"><div class="v">847</div><div class="l">se sumaron hoy</div></div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <section class="feats" id="feats">
      <h2>// Stack Operativo</h2>
      <div class="feat-grid">
        <div class="fc"><div class="ic">💸</div><div class="t">Cobranzas Auto</div><div class="d">Detecta vencidas. Manda recordatorios calientes. Te avisa cuando entró la plata.</div></div>
        <div class="fc"><div class="ic">🧾</div><div class="t">Factura Vocal</div><div class="d">"Hacé factura a Pablo por 850.000". Listo. NFS-e · CFDI · DIAN · AFIP.</div></div>
        <div class="fc"><div class="ic">📅</div><div class="t">Agenda Neural</div><div class="d">"Recordame mañana 9 ir al taller". Llega el aviso. Punto. Nunca olvidás nada.</div></div>
        <div class="fc"><div class="ic">📊</div><div class="t">Resumen Live</div><div class="d">"¿Cómo voy este mes?". Te muestra entró · falta · gastaste. En segundos.</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      © 2026 ZYMPLO · CYBERPUNK_NODE_06 ·
      <a href="/lab/">LAB</a> · <a href="/">LANDING</a> · <a href="/lab/v07/">V07 →</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
